// Parameter: pDataFolder
// Folder that holds the six model CSVs. Must end with a path separator.
// In Power BI Desktop: Home > Transform data > Manage Parameters > New Parameter,
// Name = pDataFolder, Type = Text, then paste the folder path as Current Value.
// Or create a Blank Query, open Advanced Editor and paste the line below.
"C:\rmg-export-forecasting\data\processed\powerbi\" meta [IsParameterQuery = true, Type = "Text", IsParameterQueryRequired = true]
